{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"ideal-gas-law-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"ideal-gas-law-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["ideal-gas-law-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Usa PV = nRT, donde P es la presión absoluta, V es el volumen, n es la cantidad de gas en moles, T es la temperatura absoluta en kelvin y R = ZXQPH0000QXZ J/(mol·K). Introduce exactamente tres valores positivos y deja el valor para resolver en blanco.","record_id":"d1116df8fe89e06eabba1fcd1fad782a451553db5250d1d6e51b23dbc524a7b6","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":2.1738768525000296,"source":"Use PV = nRT, where P is absolute pressure, V is volume, n is amount of gas in moles, T is absolute temperature in kelvin and R = 8.314462618 J/(mol·K). Enter exactly three positive values and leave the value to solve blank. Unit conversions are handled automatically.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"4651fb77a61dd94edc9cdfbe4cde1980dce43f4d52adb928210f7b3526566051","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Usa PV = nRT, donde P es la presión absoluta, V es el volumen, n es la cantidad de gas en moles, T es la temperatura absoluta en kelvin y R = 8.314462618 J/(mol·K). Introduce exactamente tres valores positivos y deja el valor para resolver en blanco.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
